{"author":{"id":"038d65070aa747b6bc9d50939fa697ec871a40ed259db54429b255bbef2581d6"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1793043081,"nonce":"+ZV3wGUQNMqUcsxw7vZQNegB7Ms=","title":"Provision private workspace sessions through MSB on the NUC","message":"Implement the Rust RUNNER contract under native/runner and exercise it against the real local MSB runtime on the NUC. Authenticate control-plane operations, validate stable owner/repository workspace IDs, authorize GitHub access before checkout, persist idempotent provisioning state and admission limits, and provide explicit cleanup. Checkouts must disable ambient hooks/configuration, keep GitHub tokens out of arguments/logs/on-disk config/guests, reject unsafe paths and bound checkout contents.\n\nThe gateway connection credential stays in the Rust host service. Relay WebSockets through MSB exec --stream and the session's private framed loopback transport, without publishing guest ports or passing the credential into the VM. Add a byte-faithful native session bridge command with EOF cleanup. Use private owned workspace/state volumes, restricted guests, no network and bounded lifetime/resources for the local pilot. Force the local MSB backend.\n\nTest concurrent duplicate opens, authorization/owner mismatches, unsafe checkout, failed/interrupted provisioning, retained registry restart, private-token containment, real guest filesystem/program traffic, tunnel disconnect cleanup and sandbox deletion. Reuse the verified NUC runtime and cached image; do not alter unrelated workloads. Run the local Worker through the real Rust runner and MSB guest, then refresh WASM/session artifacts for testing.\n\nThis is a real local provisioning path, not complete automatic VM recovery or production deployment. Complete filesystem/Git manifests, external-write reconciliation, stable document identities, distributed compute leases/fencing and restoration orchestration remain under 52138fcda83502ec87679713955f7cf7c7f7e8654a0ef55ba60357bd0f22a904 and 670bd15d5f2a4c8fdd82da62e9b72599f9a689affc5682a7b621f81fd72156c0. Keep automaticRestore:false. Notify the user when real Cloudflare account/bucket/auth/domain resources are required; local emulation remains sufficient here.","files":null}]}